      "id": 32623,
      "name": "Omanta",
      "slug": "omanta",
      "former_names": [
        "ClinSIGHT AI"
      ],
      "small_logo_thumb_url": "https://bookface-images.s3.amazonaws.com/small_logos/ae1812a6e6a806880355a25e542d3970bd58deb5.png",
      "website": "https://omanta.com/",
      "all_locations": "San Francisco, CA, USA",
      "long_description": "Omanta is a personalized research lab for patients who have exhausted standard options, want to prepare proactively for recurrence, or are living with an unresolved diagnosis.\r\n\r\nWe direct the full operational infrastructure, personnel, expertise, and technology of a large research program toward understanding and addressing the challenges of individual patients across oncology, rare disease, and undiagnosed conditions.\r\n\r\nFor clinicians, we act as a collaborative partner, providing a living roadmap for ongoing patient care built on a rigorous and evolving scientific evidence base.\r\n\r\nWe fully operationalize patient-specific research programs, covering tissue logistics, diagnostic follow-up, data integration, multiomic analysis, therapeutic strategy development, and more.\r\n\r\nOmanta brings context and clarity to complex cases, helping clinicians see more of the scientific picture as they decide how best to care for their patients.",
      "one_liner": "A research lab for one",
      "team_size": 4,
      "highlight_black": false,
